# {{ project_name }}

{{ project_name }} is a small, tested data pipeline generated with
[data-pipeline-template](https://github.com/willowvibe/data-pipeline-template).
It fetches hourly weather for {{ cities | length }} cities from
[Open-Meteo](https://open-meteo.com/), keeps the raw JSON for replay, loads it into
`{{ warehouse }}`, and models it with dbt into daily city summaries and all-time city
extremes.

